00:42:58.770 --> 00:43:08.650
<v One Of The Hens>We're going to sleep together, you know? Because we have so many beds. Each room have a bed in it. We're going to sleep together. Somebody's going to sleep with me that weekend.
<v One Of The Hens>我们要睡在一起，你知道吗？因为我们有那么多床。每个房间里都有张床。那个周末我们要睡在一起。有人会和我睡。

00:43:08.650 --> 00:43:22.780
<v Ira  Glass>But the men in your lives, they must have their friends who they hang with?
<v Ira  Glass>但你们生活中的男人们，他们肯定有朋友一起聚吧？

00:43:22.780 --> 00:43:27.600
<v One Of The Hens>Yeah, they do. They do.
<v One Of The Hens>是的，他们有。他们有。

00:43:27.600 --> 00:43:32.290
<v One Of The Hens>But they don't have the same kind of bond. You know, they got friends that they hang with.
<v One Of The Hens>但他们没有那种纽带。你知道，他们有一起聚的朋友。

00:43:32.290 --> 00:43:40.960
<v One Of The Hens>I don't think men have the same kind of relationship that women have.
