00:43:40.960 --> 00:43:52.330
<v One Of  The  Hens>Yeah, I think it's very much a women's thing. Definitely a women's thing.
<v One Of  The  Hens>是的，我认为这非常像是女性特有的事情。绝对是女性的事情。

00:43:52.330 --> 00:44:01.890
<v One Of  The      Hens>I think it's very much a women's thing.
