<v Tiny>When I get with the Hens, I'm me. I'm Tiny. You know, I don't have to be [UNINTELLIGIBLE]. I don't have to be wife. I don't have to be mother. I'm not sitting up there flirting with anybody where I got to be a sexy broad. I'm Tiny, naturally. And anything that comes to my mind I can say it. And they're going to say, oh, is that how you think about it? Well I think this way and I like that input. But it's a natural thing.
<v Tiny>当我和“母鸡们”在一起时，我就是我自己。我是泰妮。你知道，我不需要是[听不清]。我不需要是妻子。我不需要是母亲。我不需要坐在那里和任何人调情，假装自己是个性感的荡妇。我就是泰妮，自然地。任何我脑子里闪过的想法我都可以说出来。她们会说，哦，你是这么想的吗？嗯，我这么想，我喜欢那个建议。但这是一种自然而然的事情。

00:44:33.600 --> 00:44:37.660
<v One Of The Hens>Hey, my seatbelt is working--
